        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Detail\n\nThis is the background a graph is rendered on -- the passive surface this node presents when it's seen from outside itself: referenced in a workspace, shown collapsed, browsed past rather than opened.\n\nIt owns this content directly. What this template actually teaches about Property lives on its landing content, reached by opening the graph itself, not by delegating this background to it."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791315220667,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
